  "content": "<h1><strong>Keerdm的僵尸末日 essentials</strong></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_737e5d99-63b4-4dcb-bc66-d0236240fd81.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"2\"></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkeerdm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_e1176f98-5369-4e03-82b3-c78a7931710c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"804\" height=\"138\"></span></a></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_11a36afe-b55c-474a-ab88-d6a844121e5c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"2\"></p>\n<h2><strong>说明</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_e5481172-ddee-46b4-820b-de6c45e7b637.png\"></p>\n<p>（说明中唯一必要部分是按下“Customize”（自定义），然后将世界风格从“Standard”（标准）更改为 keerdm_zombie_essentials:testworld。）</p>\n<h3><strong>若要获得画廊图片中显示的效果，请选择 talluildings 预设。</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>请在评论或提问前阅读完整描述！</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>如果已安装此模组且未遵循说明，请勿在 Lost Cities 的 GitHub 上提交问题!!!!!!!!</strong></span></h1>\n<p>此模组<strong>完美</strong>适合喜欢<strong>僵尸末日整合包</strong>的玩家。它修改了<strong>The Lost Cities</strong>中的建筑，赋予其<strong>后启示录</strong>的外观。</p>\n<p><strong>欢迎在评论区留下任何建议或问题！(:</strong></p>\n<h2><strong>特性：</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>经过修改的城市</strong>，带来后启示录体验</li>\n<li><strong>废弃的高压电线</strong></li>\n<li>更好的<strong>小木屋</strong></li>\n<li>增强的<strong>无线电塔</strong></li>\n<li>公路上有<strong>废弃汽车</strong></li>\n<li>风景中散布着<strong>风力涡轮机</strong></li>\n<li>城市战利品箱中有<strong>可拾取的枪支和弹药</strong> <strong>（可选）</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>此模组需要：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Immersive Weathering</strong></li>\n<li><strong>The Lost Cities</strong></li>\n<li>可选：<strong>Vic's Point Blank</strong>，<strong>Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ)</strong> 或 <strong>Timeless and Classics TAC)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>从<strong>v1.1（含 TACZ）</strong>或<strong>v1.2（含 Vic's Point Blank）</strong>开始，<strong>枪支和弹药</strong>将生成在城市战利品箱中，增加沉浸感。</p>\n<h3><strong>v1.4 新增内容：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>公路上现在有废弃汽车</strong></li>\n<li>风景中添加了<strong>风力涡轮机</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>枪械模组支持：</strong></h3>\n<p>v1.2 之后的版本将包含两个独立版本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一个支持<strong>Vic's Point Blank</strong></li>\n<li>一个支持<strong>Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>兼容性：</strong></h2>\n<table style=\"width:70.516%;border-width:3px;border-color:#ECF0F1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">版本</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.18.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.19.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.20.1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.0</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.1</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"widt