\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>枪和弹药 (TAC)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>枪和弹药 (TACZ)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>枪和弹药 (Vic's Point Blank)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>增强型无线电塔</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>升级版小木屋</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>带有废弃汽车的公路</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>风力涡轮机</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>使用方法：</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>请注意：</strong></h3>\n<p>欢迎将此模组包含在你的整合包中。但是，严禁分享此模组的修改版本，否则可能导致法律行动。</p>\n<p>鼓励你在 YouTube 上制作关于此模组的视频，前提是你必须在视频描述中提到模组名称、提供模组链接，或包含包含该模组的整合包信息。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>许可证澄清：</strong></p>\n<p>此模组保留所有权利，正如本 CurseForge 页面明确声明的那样。之前对不同许可证的任何引用（例如在 mods.toml 文件中）均为无意之举，并不授权重新分发、修改或重用该内容。请确保你遵守本页面上概述的许可条款。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>（CurseForge 将自动下载 TACZ 版本。如果你想要 Vic's Point Blank 版本，你需要进入版本列表并手动下载。）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_a195045f-6419-49c4-b58a-17589bdd23a9.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>灵感来源于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lughtmon/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LughtMon</a></p>",
